# Manuscripts and private sample Books remain local-only. Document formats
# are ignored everywhere by default. ADR 0043 permitted exact-root SampleBooks
# files that the Owner separately designated through an authorized Issue and
# pull request; ADR 0079 §5 narrowed that admission to exact `sample1.docx`,
# so `SampleBooks/` now admits exactly two paths and refuses everything else.
# Placement alone was never admission, and is now refusal.
*.doc
*.docx
*.odt
*.rtf
*.pdf

# `SampleBooks/` admits exactly two paths. Any other manuscript, derivative,
# or subdirectory under it is refused, so a file that lands there is never
# committed by accident. Widening this list is an Owner decision through its
# own ADR, Issue and pull request.
/SampleBooks/*
!/SampleBooks/README.md
!/SampleBooks/sample1.docx

# The five files Issue #32 designated left the tree with slice S88 (#438) and
# remain local-only test material. They are named last so this decision wins
# over any later re-inclusion, and so `git check-ignore -v` on one of them
# reports the rule that refuses it by name.
/SampleBooks/1蟠虺（修订290326字).docx
/SampleBooks/2听漏（定稿368544字）.docx
/SampleBooks/3天兽（定稿395870字)##＊.doc
/SampleBooks/春歌(一次通读后电子版).pdf
/SampleBooks/蟠虺.docx

# Local secrets and credential material never enter the repository.
.env
*.key
*.pem

# Generated dependencies, builds, caches, business stores, and diagnostics.
node_modules/
dist/
.cache/
.runtime/
.pnpm-store/
test-results/
*.log
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-*
*.db
*.db-*
*.key.txt
